    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUMMER CAMP is a narrative party game where you and up to 3 friends create the ultimate summer adventure! Explore the camp  by uncovering hidden narratives, unique characters, and secrets across 5 thematic areas. Meet quirky counselors and campers while conquering action-packed mini-games that let winners choreograph the storyline. Mini-game victories write the camp's story, so compete to steer everyone's summer in wild directions and become camp legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445200/extras/601daec89ceb1514ff721f7b90151f9d.avif?t=1755350222\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player Local Co-Op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed mini-games with multiple variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narratives controlled by mini-game winners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 thematic camp areas filled with secrets and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky counselors and campers with unique personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-day camp sessions with evolving storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden narrative paths and camp mysteries to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable adventures with different story combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Summer Camp Demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our early demo lets you and up to 3 friends experience a taste of camp life together. You'll get one mini-game, one compressed day at camp, and one  story cycle. This is just a glimpse of what's coming in the full release. Jump in, have fun, and don't forget to wishlist us if you're feeling the camp vibes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd love to hear what you think! Your feedback helps us build the camp experience we're working toward.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUMMER CAMP is a narrative party game where you and up to 3 friends create the ultimate summer adventure! Explore the camp  by uncovering hidden narratives, unique characters, and secrets across 5 thematic areas. Meet quirky counselors and campers while conquering action-packed mini-games that let winners choreograph the storyline. Mini-game victories write the camp's story, so compete to steer everyone's summer in wild directions and become camp legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445200/extras/601daec89ceb1514ff721f7b90151f9d.avif?t=1755350222\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player Local Co-Op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed mini-games with multiple variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narratives controlled by mini-game winners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 thematic camp areas filled with secrets and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky counselors and campers with unique personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-day camp sessions with evolving storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden narrative paths and camp mysteries to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable adventures with different story combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Summer Camp Demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our early demo lets you and up to 3 friends experience a taste of camp life together. You'll get one mini-game, one compressed day at camp, and one  story cycle. This is just a glimpse of what's coming in the full release. Jump in, have fun, and don't forget to wishlist us if you're feeling the camp vibes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'd love to hear what you think! Your feedback helps us build the camp experience we're working toward.</p>",
